LIVE_DELIVERY={"role": "returns", "id": "9241935f-95a6-4827-9657-0cf8c163e3f3", "content": "{\"version\": 2, \"case_id\": \"RET-f0c0a6dc2a7f\", \"request_key\": \"zoo-tool-ctc_01M421WRWSAZJAJBJN1THDNXYS\", \"message\": \"@nmsharma/returns **Policy finding \\u2014 RET-f0c0a6dc2a7f (version 2)**\\n\\n**Condition:** Sealed \\u2014 confirmed by merchant inspection (`inspection_condition: sealed`, `condition_confirmed: true`).\\n\\n**Applicable policy:** POL-002 \\u2014 *Direct forwarding*\\n> \\\"A sealed returned item may go to a waiting buyer only when the SKU matches, the arrival meets the buyer deadline, and the merchant approves the current plan.\\\"\\n\\n**Route assessment against policy:**\\n- **Buyer A (BUY-001):** Ineligible \\u2014 route system reports \\\"Buyer order already fulfilled.\\\" POL-002 forwarding conditions cannot be met for this buyer.\\n- **Warehouse (dest-warehouse):** Eligible \\u2014 $15.00 total, 48h transit. No policy restriction on routing a sealed item to warehouse.\\n- **Inspection center (dest-inspection):** Ineligible \\u2014 system reports \\\"Sealed items are not accepted here,\\\" consistent with POL-002 (sealed items do not require inspection).\\n\\n**Summary:** Condition is sealed; POL-002 governs. Direct buyer forwarding is blocked by route status (fulfilled order), not by condition or inspection. The warehouse route is the only currently eligible destination. Merchant approval is required before any shipment proceeds. No inspection block is in play, so no fulfillment escalation is needed at this stage.\"}"}
