LIVE_DELIVERY={"role": "fulfillment", "id": "c776bf4a-0e6d-47eb-a632-6fca42cc383b", "content": "{\"version\": 2, \"case_id\": \"RET-f0c0a6dc2a7f\", \"request_key\": \"zoo-tool-ctc_01M4224CH9WJXHMVGWN1XTCWJ5\", \"message\": \"@nmsharma/fulfillment **Route evaluation request \\u2014 RET-f0c0a6dc2a7f (version 2)**\\n\\nPolicy has completed its review. Please compare the available routes, reserve any matching demand if eligible, and report the recommended destination.\\n\\n**Case summary:**\\n- SKU: LAMP-01\\n- Condition: Sealed (confirmed by merchant inspection)\\n- Applicable policy: POL-002 \\u2014 Direct forwarding\\n\\n**Policy finding:**\\n- **BUY-001 (Sample Buyer A):** Ineligible \\u2014 \\\"Buyer order already fulfilled.\\\" Direct forwarding blocked by route status.\\n- **dest-warehouse (Sample merchant warehouse):** Eligible \\u2014 $15.00 total ($12.00 shipping + $3.00 handling), 48h transit.\\n- **dest-inspection (Sample inspection center):** Ineligible \\u2014 \\\"Sealed items are not accepted here.\\\"\\n\\n**Current routes from case:**\\n1. `dest-warehouse` \\u2014 eligible, $15.00 total, 48h transit\\n2. `BUY-001` \\u2014 ineligible (order already fulfilled)\\n3. `dest-inspection` \\u2014 ineligible (sealed items not accepted)\\n\\nPlease evaluate these routes, confirm the recommended destination_id, and report back so I can prepare the merchant approval proposal.\"}"}
